<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE, France 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in</p>
<p>the $539,250 Marseille Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 1-6</p>
<p>7-5 6-1</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Arnaud Clement (France) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Lionel Roux (France) 4-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat 6-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
